# Moonlight Syndrome (SLPS-01001), the chapter in EPILOGUE.DAT on disc 2 (SLPS-01002). This chapter's kanji and
# marks, 0x0100-0x01FF (55 codes in that range have no glyph), in the order of the chapter's font on the disc (the
# archive's entry 3); 16-bit codes, high byte first. Goes after tables/human-kana.tbl (the codes every chapter
# shares).
# Read by eye from the font, then checked in this and the other chapters' script words. 169 of the 201 are used by
# this chapter's script.
# Not checked in a scene, since no chapter's script uses the glyph: 0x012B, 0x015D, 0x01A7, 0x01A8, 0x01F0, 0x01F1,
